            <ArticleTitle>Bile Acid Control of Metabolism and Inflammation in Obesity, Type 2 Diabetes, Dyslipidemia, and Nonalcoholic Fatty Liver Disease.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1679-1694.e3</MedlinePgn>
